  "details": "The oculus store version is better than the steam version in terms of  performance. The thing is, network lag spikes happens every 15 or 20 minutes, making me heard people talking like stuttering. It happens of a few seconds an it goes away. It doesnt happen in steam version. it's not critical but kind of annoying to tell the person im speaking to every time it happens.\n\nUpdate 13.08.2026 : This is network and ISP issue, not vrchat. Use cloudflare warp when it happens, and wait a few days or weeks to have the isp give new IP address.",
